OL,3,ATrump addresses UN General Assembly
OL,4,Aafter Guterres says 'world faultlines
OL,5,Awidening'
OL,6,
OL,7,FUS President Donald Trump has addressed
OL,8,Fthe United Nations General Assembly -
OL,9,Fwatch our live coverage from New York
OL,10,Fabove
OL,12,FAfter an early focus on domestic
OL,13,Fissues, he turned his attention to the
OL,14,FBoard of Peace and Iran, which he said
OL,15,Fcannot have nuclear weapons
OL,17,FOn Ukraine, Trump again claimed an end
OL,18,Fto the war with Russia is near - while
OL,19,Fhe also said the US will rename AI as
OL,20,F"super intelligence"
OL,23,APub: 22-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
